== Description ==

'''Gear''' is a crafted component in ''[[Human Host]]'', crafted at the [[Anvil]]. It appears as an ingredient in 7 downstream recipes at 3 different workbenches, including [[Electric Motor Engine]], [[Bicycle Generator]], [[Solar Generator]], [[Driver's Seat]], [[Spiked Axe]], [[Firearm Kit]], among others. See the ''Used in'' table for the full consumer list.

